flowchart LR
    push([git push]) --> lint
    subgraph build [Build]
        lint[Lint] --> unit[Unit tests]
        lint --> types[Type check]
        unit --> bundle[[Bundle]]
        types --> bundle
    end
    subgraph test [Integration]
        direction TB
        e2e[E2E suite] --> perf[Perf budget]
